<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - DE BEERS H1 EARNINGS UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - DE BEERS H1 EARNINGS UP.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, per linked unit (U.S. cents)  204  vs 180</p>
<p>    Div (U.S cts)			    27.4 vs 27.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income			    507  vs 482</p>
<p>    Diamond account			  510  vs 447</p>
<p>Full name: De Beers Consolidated Mines Ltd/De Beers Centenary AG.</p>
<p>NOTE - De Beers said the interim earnings included an exceptional item of $75 million comprising the group's surplus arising from the disposal of its interests in JCI Ltd, less a provision in respect of an anticipated loss on the disposal of its interest in Lonrho Plc.</p>
<p>Analysts polled by Reuters forecast a net attributable earnings of between $510 and $543 million.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
